+uses \(r_p-1\), whereas algebraic genus bookkeeping uses \(\delta_p\).  For an
+ordinary node the two happen to agree:
+\((r,\delta,\mu_{\rm Milnor})=(2,1,1)\).  For a minimal cusp they do not:
