+\[
+ \begin{array}{c|ccc}
+ &d&\delta_{p_0}&\delta_\infty+\sum_{q\ne p_0}\delta_q\\ \hline
+ \text{S1a}&4&1&2\\
+ \text{S1b}&4&3&0
+ \end{array}
+\]
+satisfy (4.1).  They are arithmetic controls only, not curve or Keller-map
