+
+| datum | branched component \(D_A\) | trivial-owner component \(D_B\) |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| \((\mu,\operatorname{corr},s)\) | \((2,1,1)\) | \((1,0,1)\) |
+| \(W=\sum s\mu\) | \(2\) | \(1\) |
+| generic affine fibre \(a=5-W\) | \(3\) | \(4\) |
