+
+For the charge's unibranch reading at \(p_0\), let
+\(b=r_{B,p_0}\).  Then LOC is
+\[
+ a_{p_0}+2+b+1=5,qquad a_{p_0}=2-b,qquad 0\le b\le2. \tag{3.5}
