+INT proves it only for the explicit ROW-NF \(S_4\) sextics and transported
+octics, using family/stratum-specific infinity-word data recorded as
+\(2+2+2\) and \(g_5^2g_1^4\) (`INT:30-60,90-98`).  It is not the assertion
